    <div class="ops-insight-strip"><div class="ops-insight"><i>⏱️</i><div><b>36-minute target</b><span>Journey timing target for each meal</span></div></div><div class="ops-insight"><i>🧑‍⚕️</i><div><b>${review} clinical review${review===1?'':'s'}</b><span>Dietitian queue requiring attention</span></div></div><div class="ops-insight"><i>🛵</i><div><b>${inTransit} bedside delivery${inTransit===1?'':'ies'}</b><span>Orders marked as on the patient leg</span></div></div></div>
